WEBVTT

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.270
Let me tell you one thing first...

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.170
Homura-tan, you see...

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:14.440
He's not a normal Sekirei.

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:17.360
I'm sure he'd get mad at me if I gave you any more details,

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:21.240
but if you want to know more,
you'll have to catch him and ask yourself!

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:36.320
atarashii yakusoku ga kokoro wo tsuyoku tsunagu

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:36.320
Our new promise binds our hearts together strongly

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:43.410
kawaru sekai ni kane ga hibiku yukou

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:43.410
The bell rings in the changing world, let's go

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:50.250
owari naki tatakai ga subete wo hiki saitemo

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:50.250
Even if the endless fight shreds everything apart,

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:56.430
kimi no hohoemi tada shinjite

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:56.430
I will believe in your smile

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:00.640
kimi no yume mamoreru nara

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:00.640
If I can protect your dream,

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:04.230
itami sae dakishimeyou

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:04.230
I will even embrace pain

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:13.530
kasane au kono omoi mune no chikai yuzurenai

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:13.530
I can't let go of these piling feelings, this oath in my heart

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:20.280
aa, sora no haruka hate made

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:20.280
Ah, all the way to the end of the sky,

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:28.500
sou, kakete yuku you na kasoku shiteku jounetsu

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:25.080
yes, my passion accelerates

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:28.500
as if it were rushing through my body

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:34.670
aa, donna unmei datte

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:34.670
Ah, no matter what kind of fate awaits me,

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:45.810
sou, takaku koeteku makenai yuuki kureta kara

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.970
yes, I can fly high over it

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:45.810
because you gave me this undefeatable courage

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.880
Sixth Wing

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.880
Words of Marriage

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:55.230
The Northern area starts here.

00:01:55.930 --> 00:02:00.480
All the trains have been cancelled ever since they spotted more escapees and their Sekirei.

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:03.540
The checks have become even more strict after that.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:07.400
Anyway, let's search for the last unwinged, No. 108!

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:11.780
But, we don't know for sure if the last unwinged one really is Kuu...

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:14.460
Even so, we can't just leave her alone!

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:17.230
I'd feel bad if some weird Ashikabi got a hold of her.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:18.910
Didn't I mention them before?

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:22.260
The weirdos that have been checking out Shiina.

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:24.630
Like that creep over there.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.270
What's up with him?

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:43.480
Whether it's one-on-one or not doesn't matter any more!

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:46.340
Mutsu! Go and finish off the fluttering one!

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:47.240
Roger.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:49.660
Look at those flames! The natural light!

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:51.680
That's rare! I want it!

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:52.750
Mutsu?

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.310
Oh? What do we have here?

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:58.280
If it isn't Mikogami Hayato-sama from the South... Am I right?

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:02.560
This presence... He's an Ashikabi.

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:17.390
An Ashikabi?

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:19.850
Hey! Is that fluttering one yours?

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:24.060
Why don't you return something that belongs to us?

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:26.980
I am with Higa Izumi of the East.

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:28.650
Higa of the East?

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:31.820
I'm Kakizaki, his secretary.

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:33.910
Let's take this opportunity to get to know each other.

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:35.120
Sekirei, huh?

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:37.790
Rest assured.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:44.500
We won't do you any harm if you behave while we capture No. 06.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:48.410
This is pissing me off! Adults and their hypocritical courtesy!

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.100
Mutsu, take care of them!

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:52.300
Don't make it sound so simple, man.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:56.880
If we had at least two or three more with us, this would've been a different story...

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.600
And the last unwinged one doesn't seem to be here.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.540
You can kiss me if you want, you know.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:04.770
Norito, norito, norito, norito...

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:04.770
TL Note: Norito is a ritual performed by winged Sekirei and their Ashikabi in order to access their special moves.

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.340
I'll pass.

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:10.650
Well, whatever they are, it does not matter to me.

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.070
That brat...

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.490
Akitsu!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:22.900
We're retreating.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.690
What? Are we running away?

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:27.250
That one's already done for.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.280
Give up on her.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:29.750
Eh? Returning empty handed?

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:37.050
You asked me why I have a master, right?

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:39.220
This is bad.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.400
Such wonderful eyes, filled with determination...

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:51.020
You won't even fear death if it's for the sake of your Ashikabi.

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:52.550
That's the kind of eyes you have.

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:56.570
You don't become one's master just because you became an Ashikabi.

00:04:56.570 --> 00:05:00.660
You do so only once you're recognized as one. That's what I think.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:05.400
Even a broken being such as myself yearned for him.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:08.430
Even though the crest hasn't been engraved onto my body,

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:11.890
he is my master.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.090
You can get winged, can't you?

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:18.900
I'm so envious of you.

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:27.220
Will you come with me now?

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:30.010
I heard a loud sound just now.

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.440
It came from over there!

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:32.860
Let's hurry up, Shiina!

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:36.360
Yukari-san, are you all right?

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:41.140
You... Watch out where you're driving!

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.240
Huh?

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:45.970
Wasn't it you who jumped out all of a sudden?!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.100
Wha-?! That's because you were

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:50.960
Your knee...

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:54.820
Jeez! A maiden's leg's been bruised!

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:55.970
And it's your fault!

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:59.300
C'mon, just spit on it and it will heal.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.440
Let's go, Shiina!

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:07.560
O-Okay.

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:15.700
Quite the aggressive babe, wasn't she?

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.650
She sure can give some hard kicks.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:24.090
I won't kill you if you stay still and listen to me.

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:27.440
Sekirei's Guardian?

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:29.790
At least, until they meet their Ashikabi...

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:32.710
If only there was someone who would protect these Sekirei...

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:36.370
Will you take this burden upon yourself, Homura?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.230
Those children...

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:40.880
If the children I protected...

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:46.410
were to meet their Ashikabi by chance...

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:49.870
I would be more than satisfied.

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:51.100
But...

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.220
I won't be able to kill Minaka because of that?

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:03.840
Homura!

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:04.870
Well done.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:07.700
Leave the rest to us.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:11.620
Uzume, are you...

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:14.680
Unwinged! She's still unwinged!

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:16.760
She's burning, Kakizaki.

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:17.900
What should we do?

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:21.590
It seems her power output is unstable in her current state.

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:24.760
I'm not sure if she's worthy of becoming one of Higa-sama's Sekirei.

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:26.140
Higa...

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:27.660
The Ashikabi from the East, huh?

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:35.210
I see.

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:37.400
So we're playing this kind of game.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:39.600
What a shame.

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:42.570
You're just wasting your time.

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:44.490
Minaka!

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:48.240
If you want me to become the prize of this ridiculous game you set up,

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:50.870
I would rather melt down right here!

00:07:55.370 --> 00:08:00.570
Behold No. 06 Homura's downfall, Minaka!

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:07.830
I'm sorry...

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:11.960
Miya...

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:13.130
Takami-san...

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:16.730
I... can't...

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:20.340
And you're supposed to be my rival?!

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:23.900
I'm worried about you, Kagari-tan.

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:27.510
I-I'm just worried!

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:29.620
Kagari-san...

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.480
What are you doing, Homura?

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:41.310
I believe I told you...

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:43.670
that I won't allow you to give up!

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:47.290
Kagari-san!

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:56.600
Sanada of the West?

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.890
No. It's someone else, isn't it?

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:02.340
The North... is it?

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:04.620
You guys...

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:05.770
Why...?

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.030
Ouch...

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:09.700
K-Kagari-san, are you all right?

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:11.940
Sahashi...

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:12.460
Kagari-

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:13.280
Don't come any closer!

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:16.500
Didn't I already tell you that I don't want your sympathy?

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:18.550
Th-This is no sympathy!

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:20.740
He's right, it's not sympathy!

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:25.520
We all came here to collect the rent for the Landlady!

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:27.460
Mu-Musubi-chan...

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:28.300
Homura!

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:32.040
You sure have some guts to keep deceiving us for such a long time.

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:34.190
You better be prepared when we get back.

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:37.620
Kagari-chan, we came to bring you back!

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:40.720
It would be kind of troublesome if you killed off the president just like that.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.830
I want my past romance to remain beautiful.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.710
It's not that I have any regrets though, really...

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:47.400
Regrets?

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:49.820
They're the enemy, right? What should we do?

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:52.010
Talk about a failed gamble...

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:55.240
Stealing an unwinged Sekirei right in front of us...

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:56.830
That's truly annoying.

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:00.010
Well then, let's clean them up!

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:01.830
You're going to fight as well, of course,

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.750
No. 10.

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:06.260
Is that... the Clothed Sekirei?

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:08.160
You're doomed, now that you're gonna face me!

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:09.310
Hold on.

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:10.380
She's mine.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:22.450
Since the winner's already decided,
we'll be taking the unwinged one with us.

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:25.000
I'm No. 101, Oriha.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.690
My Ashikabi is Higa Izumi.

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:28.640
A surprise attack, huh?

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.250
How insolent.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:34.230
You sure have some nerve to be pointing your blades at me.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.910
I'm No. 09, Tsukiumi!

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:40.290
I'll pay you back tenfold for your insolence!

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:46.500
No. 88, Musubi! A close-combat fighter!

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.000
No. 86, Katsuragi...

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.720
I'm a kicking type... I think.

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:53.340
Incoming!

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:56.800
You don't seem too surprised to find me here.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.460
Not really.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:01.730
I already knew the reason why you're doing this, so I was just observing you...

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:04.650
How you assaulted No. 95,

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.820
how you tried to provoke me into fighting you,

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:11.880
as well as the moment you aimed for my Sekirei crest.

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:16.040
And also the time you disappeared from the Izumo Inn.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:20.370
Did you think that I, Miya, or Matsu wouldn't have noticed?

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:25.520
Really... I just can't keep up with you...

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:28.000
There's one thing I want you to say:

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:31.210
Tell me that you're doing all of this for your Ashikabi.

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:35.440
Isn't that the only reason the Sekirei fight for?

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:37.810
My god! It's love, isn't it?

00:11:37.810 --> 00:11:39.650
It must be love!

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:42.930
Nee-san, you just spoiled the mood...

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:46.060
But, this is what Sekirei are meant to do.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.860
Fine, I'll fight you.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:51.030
Bring it on.

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:54.680
Heh... I wonder why she underestimates me that much.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:59.450
But, I will prove you wrong this instant!

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:12.960
So that's the unknown Ashikabi that's allied with the Demon of the North?

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:15.930
He looks like just a disappointing boy to me, though.

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:22.310
Why you-! Let go of me!

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:29.290
Kagari-san, we're not here because of sympathy.

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:31.400
Um, you see...

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:33.580
I came here to...

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.040
To ask you if you'd like to become my Sekirei.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:37.360
So...

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.530
You're the same.

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:43.590
You're just like all the other people that are forced to act according to Minaka's orders...

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:47.580
For you...

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:51.170
Whatever happens to me is just a game, isn't it?

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:53.100
What you really want is my power.

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:54.960
Do you want to increase your numbers that badly?

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:57.060
But I have to disappoint you...

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:58.430
I'm broken.

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:01.780
Isn't this body just unsightly?

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:04.250
You can't even tell if I'm a man or a woman.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.500
And my power is unstable as well.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:10.350
I'm not even allowed to live for my own sake.

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:12.420
I...

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:15.780
I will incinerate my existence right here.

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:16.990
I never existed in the first place!

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:19.440
My existence...

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:20.860
holds no meaning...

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:35.600
Hot!

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:36.880
What are you

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:37.970
Let go of me!

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.530
You'll burn too!

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:40.640
I'm not letting go.

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.190
There's no way that you're meaningless.

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:42.640
Sahashi!

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.160
Kagari-san...

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:46.220
You're an important comrade to us at the Izumo Inn.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:48.060
I was so happy...

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:51.310
when we fell from the sky and got hurt...

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:52.560
You took care of us.

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:58.870
And when we got thrown out of my apartment you led me to the Izumo Inn.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:00.780
I was really happy back then...

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:02.500
Just because of something like that...?

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:05.330
Whatever, just let go of me!

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:07.370
Mom told me...

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:12.710
that you saved both Musubi-chan and Kuu-chan...

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:17.380
and Tsukiumi said that you're a rival she doesn't ever want to lose to...

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:21.290
Everyone came here to save you...

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:23.150
Their mutual feelings...

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.740
My feelings...

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:26.690
are not a game!

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:27.960
Ouch...

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:29.000
Kagari-san?

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.340
Back off...

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:33.720
I can't control my powers any longer.

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:35.710
I'm already...

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:36.690
I will...

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:38.820
I will definitely not let you die!

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:41.700
I will... definitely...

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:42.370
Saha-

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:55.840
Oh yes!

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:58.170
You finally did it, Mina-tan!

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:00.350
Oh my, what are they doing?

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:01.760
It's nothing, Miya-tan!

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:03.630
Oh my, would you look at this...

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:05.550
This is...

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:14.100
Kagari-chan...

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.890
The flames are calming down...

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.200
What is this feeling?

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:32.660
The burning fever and the vexing pain have disappeared...

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:37.920
A unique sensation of power, merging my body and soul into one...

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:44.880
Homura, since you're a unique Sekirei, an Ashikabi that would be able to wing you does not exist yet.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.600
However, this is only a matter of time.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.560
The strength of an Ashikabi depends on the strength of your bond.

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:52.840
The feelings of holding someone dear...

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:56.970
The deeper that bond is, the stronger an Ashikabi becomes.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:01.150
Someday, a person who will be able to reach you will appear.

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:05.110
The one to become your key to creating even more bonds...

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:09.690
That will be your Ashikabi.

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:12.180
The flames...

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:14.710
seem to have stopped.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.370
Thank... goodness...

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:18.200
Sahashi!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:21.690
I-I'm sorry...

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.360
Are you stupid?

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:25.520
Jumping right into the flames like that...

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:29.790
My mother told me that your power would stabilize if I were to wing you...

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.090
That's why...

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.770
Well, I'm sorry...

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:35.560
Are you trying to apologize for kissing me?

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:38.080
I am, sorry...

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:40.670
Jeez, what a man...

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:45.860
I don't care any more.

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:48.340
Just thinking about it would make me feel idiotic.

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:53.410
You're going to take responsibility, right, Sahashi Minato?

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:55.330
Re-Responsibility?

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:57.370
By responsibility, you mean...

00:16:58.590 --> 00:17:00.550
For now and forever...?

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:07.550
That's a Sekirei's line, you idiot!

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:09.970
What's wrong, Miya-tan?

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:13.390
Something interesting is about to happen now.

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.790
I certainly did tell you to make him yours,

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:20.350
but kissing someone else in front of your faithful wife...!

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:23.070
Sekirei are interesting beings.

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:27.950
The soul which resides within their hearts will shape into these forms:

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:31.860
Anger, hatred, joy...

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.620
And above all, the feeling of love.

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:38.660
Although these overwhelming feelings certainly do have an influence on their abilities...

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:40.580
I just realized...

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:44.090
This is not interesting...

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:48.360
They don't have much impact on the efficiency of their powers,

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:51.030
but they surely will help them gradually mature.

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.350
It's there...

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:55.010
In my heart...

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.430
This is not interesting at all!

00:17:58.270 --> 00:18:00.350
I'm looking forward to what will come forth.

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:06.280
Wai- What-

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:08.490
Eight-Headed Serpent!

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:09.900
It was definitely there...

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:13.240
A black beast... It was definitely there!

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:16.640
A black bear...within me!

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:21.040
Black Paw!

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:35.950
I'm at my limit...

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:38.470
I'm sorry, Master...

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:44.350
Crap, snakes! I hate them!

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:46.020
Damn it!

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:49.130
Don't screw with me!

00:18:52.420 --> 00:18:55.750
Hey, why did you let yourself get captured, Kakizaki?

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.590
Don't mind me.

00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:01.430
It seems No. 06 has been winged.

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:03.690
They even got Katsuragi.

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:08.210
If only Higa-sama was here... I would have finished her off with my norito...!

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:09.070
Yes.

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:11.420
All right, understood.

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:14.280
Oriha, that was Higa-sama.

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:15.390
We have been ordered to retreat.

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.560
You're strong, Nee-san.

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:24.210
Really strong...

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:27.630
I heard the first 5 numbers don't screw around, but...

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:30.810
It's just a matter of experience, in various ways, that is...

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:31.670
Right?

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:32.440
However...

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:36.210
I can't afford to lose either.

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:38.890
That serious look in your eyes is just wonderful.

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:40.490
Those are the eyes of someone in love.

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:45.420
No. 10, we got orders to pull out!

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:46.830
I know it's annoying, but we're leaving!

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:53.720
You barely escaped death, Nee-san.

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:55.630
That's what I should be saying.

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:57.290
See you later.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:02.820
It's already over, huh?

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:06.290
And I wanted to check what kind of people have gathered over there.

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:10.070
Anyway, let's go back, my lovely kittens.

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:11.390
Hold it!

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:13.080
Running away is just pathetic!

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:14.240
I'm sorry...

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:16.640
Mine ran away as well.

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:19.990
You-! Next time we meet, I'll definitely...!

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:21.060
Where's Musubi-chan?

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:31.140
In case a Sekirei ceases to function,

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:37.620
it is an established rule to watch over it until the M.B.I. retrieves it, even in times of war.

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:49.600
Well then, let's go home, Minato-san.

00:20:50.490 --> 00:20:51.220
Yeah.

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:53.020
Kagari-san.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:58.360
Let's go back to Izumo Inn.

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:03.620
To be honest, I'm still confused.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:07.040
But my heart has finally calmed down.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.120
Now and forever...

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:17.590
Case closed!

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:20.720
It's not closed. It has just begun.

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:25.430
Now that Homura has been winged, the winging process of all the Sekirei has been completed.

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:28.260
Everything really begins from now on...

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:36.640
The Capital will turn into a battlefield.

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:40.000
A real fight that will achieve nothing but bloodshed.

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:53.250
unmei nante ne zenbu de kimi shidai

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:53.250
All kinds of fate depend on you

00:21:54.480 --> 00:22:02.050
tsuiteku doko made mo onaji kimochi wo kakaete

00:21:54.480 --> 00:22:02.050
I'll follow you anywhere carrying the same feelings

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:19.030
mada dare ni mo hakken sarete inai michi mo tairiku ni sou

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:19.030
Even roads that haven't been found by anyone follow the mainland

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:24.770
ichiban saki ni fumidasu you na bouken nano kono koi wa kitto

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:24.770
This love is probably like an adventure we're stepping into before anyone else

00:22:24.770 --> 00:22:29.960
shinjitsu da yo kanjiteru koto subete

00:22:24.770 --> 00:22:29.960
Everything that you feel is the truth

00:22:30.130 --> 00:22:35.600
sono koe ga ima yondeiru kara

00:22:30.130 --> 00:22:35.600
Since that voice is calling me now

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:37.380
itsudemo

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:37.380
Whenever it may be

00:22:37.380 --> 00:22:43.340
mukou da to wakatte temo issho ni tameshitai no

00:22:37.380 --> 00:22:43.340
Even if I know it's useless I want to try it out together

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:50.310
nanni mo iranai ne kimi ga warau tabi

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:50.310
I don't need anything, hey whenever you laugh

00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:56.230
ikiteru sono imi wa toki akasarete

00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:56.230
the meaning of my life becomes obvious to me

00:22:56.230 --> 00:23:02.530
unmei nante ne zenbu de kimi shidai

00:22:56.230 --> 00:23:02.530
All kinds of fate depend on you

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:08.890
tsuiteku doko made mo onaji kimochi wo

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:08.890
I'll follow you carrying the same

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:14.320
tsuyoi kimochi wo kakaete

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:14.320
strong feelings

00:23:17.810 --> 00:23:20.180
Matsu-san, what's going to happen next time?

00:23:20.180 --> 00:23:23.180
My number of lines has already been cut in half!

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:25.650
Well, whatever, it's my turn to speak now!

00:23:25.650 --> 00:23:27.490
This is when I get my screen time!

00:23:27.490 --> 00:23:30.870
Next time is: Matsu, Doing the Talk, Part 1.

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:32.890
Th-That title is somewhat...

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:34.970
Chapter 7: Distant Tale.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:36.660
Tune in next time too, and forever and ever.
